### Required `versions.tf` Constraint

```hcl
# iac/terraform/formations/aws/<formation-name>/versions.tf

terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.7.0"    # REQ-IAC-008-03a: mock_provider requires >= 1.7.0

  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 5.0"
    }
    random = {
      source  = "hashicorp/random"
      version = "~> 3.6"
    }
  }
}
```

